---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="think-story" aria-label="How the THINK bottleneck changes with AI and Poesis">
  <div class="think-story__phases">
    <article class="think-phase" aria-labelledby="think-history-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">01 · Historically<br />The THINK pathology</span>
        <h3 id="think-history-title">THINK lived in people&rsquo;s heads and prose — BUILD and RUN moved at its speed or drifted.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <strong>THINK</strong>
          <span>Implicit · manual · human-held</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>BUILD</strong>
            <span>Human</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>RUN</strong>
            <span>Human</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="think-phase__foot">
        <span class="think-phase__details-label">Pain points</span>
        <ul class="think-phase__details">
          <li>Purpose, rules, and constraints scattered across people, meetings, documents, and tools.</li>
          <li>Every handoff reconstructed THINK — and lost a little of it each time.</li>
          <li>THINK artifacts went stale as BUILD and RUN changed — definition and reality drifted apart.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--warning" aria-labelledby="think-ai-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">02 · Today<br />Gen AI on pathological THINK</span>
        <h3 id="think-ai-title">AI generates probabilistically against implicit definitions — lose speed, or lose alignment.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-phase__flow">
        <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--narrow">
          <strong>THINK</strong>
          <span>Implicit · manual · human-held</span>
        </div>
        <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>BUILD</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="think-capacity">
            <strong>RUN</strong>
            <span>AI-accelerated</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="think-phase__foot">
        <span class="think-phase__details-label">Pain points</span>
        <ul class="think-phase__details">
          <li>Keep the speed: every artifact drifts further from intent, compounding at machine pace.</li>
          <li>Restore alignment by hand: prompts, reviews, corrections, and controls consume the gain.</li>
          <li>Human attention becomes the control plane — understanding, validation, coordination, and accountability remain scarce.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="think-phase think-phase--poesis" aria-labelledby="think-poesis-title">
      <header>
        <span class="think-phase__number">03 · Decided now<br />The Poesis Gene Therapy</span>
        <h3 id="think-poesis-title">Human + AI capacity goes to THINK first — governance decides what becomes authoritative.</h3>
      </header>
      <div class="think-therapy">
        <div class="think-therapy__aside">
          <div class="think-phase__flow">
            <div class="think-capacity think-capacity--governed">
              <strong>THINK</strong>
              <span>Explicit · AI-assisted · shared</span>
            </div>
            <span class="think-phase__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <div class="think-capacity-group think-capacity-group--expanded">
              <div class="think-capacity">
                <strong>BUILD</strong>
                <span>AI-accelerated or programmatic</span>
              </div>
              <div class="think-capacity">
                <strong>RUN</strong>
                <span>AI-accelerated or programmatic</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="think-phase__foot">
            <span class="think-phase__details-label">Values</span>
            <ul class="think-phase__details">
              <li>AI sources and structures definitions upstream; humans govern what enters into effect.</li>
              <li>BUILD and RUN execute against governed definitions — traceable, with divergence surfaced immediately.</li>
              <li>Execution mode stays a choice: agentic today (SAF), increasingly deterministic and economic as the Operator (SIE) matures toward Organization as a Service.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="think-therapy__body">
          <span class="think-phase__details-label">Capabilities</span>
          <ul class="think-therapy__grid">
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="grid" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Typed definition model</span></span>
              <strong>The organization described, not documented</strong>
              <p>Subjects, relations and obligations become explicit, shared and machine-readable — BUILD and RUN execute against them, not against interpretations of them.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="layers" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Composed governance fabric</span></span>
              <strong>Frameworks and regulations, composed</strong>
              <p>TOGAF, the ISO 25000 series, GDPR, NIS2 and more attach from a catalogue and compose into one enforceable obligation set.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="handshake" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Governance lifecycle</span></span>
              <strong>AI proposes, humans put into effect</strong>
              <p>Definitions are sourced and structured upstream, then promoted through an explicit lifecycle — every authoritative change stays attributed and traceable.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="think-capability__head"><span class="think-capability__icon"><Icon name="search" size={16} /></span><span class="think-capability__step">Continuous norm evaluation</span></span>
              <strong>Definition checked against reality</strong>
              <p>Norms are evaluated into deterministic verdicts against observed reality, so divergence surfaces the moment it appears.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>